{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）下午1時許，赤柱舂磡角道一個單位的戶主報案，指從海外回來，發現兩件總值1,000萬美元、即大約7,800萬港元的珠寶不翼而飛。</p><p>警方接報到場調查，暫列盜竊案跟進，暫時無人被捕。據了解，不排除事件與其外傭有關。</p><figure><img alt=\"赤柱舂磡角道一單位發生失竊案，戶主的1,000萬美元珠寶不知所終。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192496627362041856145098.jpeg/kJo4ZBqSshqM_vABy9Y3_ZwgGzLmzlSEyOpeI-3qXiM\"/><figcaption>赤柱舂磡角道一單位發生失竊案，戶主的1,000萬美元珠寶不知所終。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"赤柱舂磡角道一單位發生失竊案，戶主的1,000萬美元珠寶不知所終。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192496625071820800175890.jpeg/vrAHfD96SxSpEcWr65r60AM8Z1_0dc4cuF48Fp1ePBY\"/><figcaption>赤柱舂磡角道一單位發生失竊案，戶主的1,000萬美元珠寶不知所終。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"赤柱一單位發生失竊案，戶主的1,000萬美元珠寶不知所終。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192496621829492736320985.jpeg/YHi_kLsn3qSf1q06C2WgpeswIXc7xhBFjU4lJKhOJSQ\"/><figcaption>赤柱一單位發生失竊案，戶主的1,000萬美元珠寶不知所終。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.040520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:23:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:43.135362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:32.624950+00:00","content_hash":"8f015eba8bf8121011bf698afa3118a6a9fd40aed7f491ede0bd371267d8297f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}